WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.880
- I put on my orange suit

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.430
because somebody's about to walk out here

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:08.220
who is a cultural icon.

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:12.030
But fun fact, do you know
that she actually worked

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:16.890
as a bricklayer and a
mortuary cosmetologist?

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.246
I gotta know what happened.

00:00:18.246 --> 00:00:20.278
Whoopi Goldberg, everybody!

00:00:20.278 --> 00:00:23.445
(audience applauding)

00:00:42.382 --> 00:00:44.057
So happy to see you.

00:00:44.057 --> 00:00:44.890
- And you.

00:00:47.706 --> 00:00:49.120
Hey, hi.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:52.761
(audience applauding)

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.700
- I know, right?

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.790
Oh my God, I'm so happy to see you.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:57.630
- Hello.

00:00:57.630 --> 00:01:00.030
- Did you put makeup on dead people?

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.620
- Yeah, oh my God, yeah.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.780
I put stuff on and you put stuff on

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:06.870
and make sure eyes don't pop open.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:09.120
- Did you have to seal them shut?

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:11.310
- Yeah, in the old days, yeah.

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:12.420
And that's what they did.

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.440
You know, they...

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.140
- Ironically, something
that is going around,

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:19.590
I can't even turn on
Instagram or any outlet,

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:22.740
I feel like, without
hearing about Sister Act 3.

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:23.573
Talk about...

00:01:23.573 --> 00:01:26.292
(audience applauding)

00:01:26.292 --> 00:01:28.860
Like, everybody wants it to happen.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:29.693
- Yeah.

00:01:29.693 --> 00:01:31.560
- Everybody's asking you, cast,

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.080
like, Kiki Palmer, obviously.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:35.577
- Everybody wants to be in it.

00:01:35.577 --> 00:01:37.118
We just got the script

00:01:37.118 --> 00:01:38.797
(Drew squeals excitedly)
on Friday.

00:01:38.797 --> 00:01:40.329
(audience applauding)

00:01:40.329 --> 00:01:41.610
- Oh, that's major!

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.800
- I'm very, very, very pleased.

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.480
Whatever's wrong, we can fix.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:48.060
And I just want them to give us a go date.

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:49.890
So you should let me know if you are in.

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:52.038
- I will. Are you kidding me?

00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:52.889
- No.

00:01:52.889 --> 00:01:54.222
- With bells on.

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:56.993
- Why not? Why not?

00:01:56.993 --> 00:01:58.575
- Anything, are you kidding?

00:01:58.575 --> 00:02:00.135
- No, let's have some fun.

00:02:00.135 --> 00:02:01.244
Remember that?

00:02:01.244 --> 00:02:02.183
Remember having fun?

00:02:02.183 --> 00:02:03.462
- I do remember having fun.

00:02:03.462 --> 00:02:04.295
- Let's have some fun.

00:02:04.295 --> 00:02:06.510
- I feel like everyone
you mention this to,

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:08.340
they're just immediately on board.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.650
You've built, this will be the third.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:11.483
- Yeah.

00:02:11.483 --> 00:02:13.980
- The holy trinity of Sister Act 3.

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:15.150
- Well, it's, listen,

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:19.803
you can't go wrong with 15 singing nuns.

00:02:19.803 --> 00:02:20.910
(audience laughing)

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.590
You just, you can't, you know.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:25.861
And there's no reason why-

00:02:25.861 --> 00:02:28.650
I don't know how many of you remember this

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:31.800
but when I was a kid, there
was a show called Batman.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:33.600
- Yes, Adam West.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.690
- Adam West, the fabulous late Adam West.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:37.523
- Yes.

00:02:37.523 --> 00:02:41.520
- And they would be walking
up the side of the building

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:46.520
and some major star would open
a window and say something.

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.970
I feel like we can incorporate that.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.644
Somebody's coming out of the confessional

00:02:53.644 --> 00:02:56.040
(audience laughing)

00:02:56.040 --> 00:02:58.444
maybe dressed as a priest or as a nun.

00:02:58.444 --> 00:02:59.277
(audience applauding)

00:02:59.277 --> 00:03:02.730
You know, anything, anything is possible.

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:05.910
- Did you see, I was
watching in real time,

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:09.090
my television was on and I had
it on Jennifer Hudson's show.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:10.500
- [Whoopi] Yes, I did.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.360
- And she came out on Halloween.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:13.193
- [Whoopi] Yes.

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:14.460
- As you and sang that song.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.330
- [Whoopi] And sang that song.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:18.114
I made everybody realize,
oh, she should be a singer.

00:03:18.114 --> 00:03:19.770
(audience laughing)

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:21.660
It's like, no, no, no.

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.090
She's brilliant, but...

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.433
- Well, and you're both EGOTs.
- She's fabulous.

00:03:26.433 --> 00:03:28.044
- Both of you are EGOTs.

00:03:28.044 --> 00:03:29.565
- Yes. Yes.

00:03:29.565 --> 00:03:32.250
(audience applauding)

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:37.020
- Now, we were looking at your
IMDB, your movie credit list.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.450
There's over 200
- Oh.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.160
Oh.
- credits on there.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:45.180
Is there anything in that
200 that you haven't done

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.498
and you're dying to do?

00:03:46.498 --> 00:03:49.950
A remake, some character
you've never gotten to play?

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.590
Anything that is like an
itch you haven't scratched?

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:53.778
- Yes, there's only one.

00:03:53.778 --> 00:03:54.611
- What?

00:03:54.611 --> 00:03:56.869
- I really want to play a monster

00:03:56.869 --> 00:03:59.670
(audience laughing)

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.649
because who would suspect me?

00:04:01.649 --> 00:04:04.710
(audience laughing)

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:07.680
Because I, you know, I've
always wanted to be a vampire

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.590
or something that was built
and it turned into me.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:13.710
And, you know, because
it's my favorite genre

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:17.910
and it's a genre I've not
ever been able to play in.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:21.210
- Do you see it like a Guillermo
del Toro type of movie?

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:22.200
- [Whoopi] Listen, if only.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.033
- Right.

00:04:23.033 --> 00:04:24.090
- Please, please.

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:26.070
- Okay, so, the last time you were here,

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.180
we both were single.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:28.350
You weren't dating.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:29.340
Are you dating now?

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:31.008
- No.
- I am.

00:04:31.008 --> 00:04:31.841
- Good.

00:04:31.841 --> 00:04:33.933
(audience applauding)

00:04:33.933 --> 00:04:34.777
Good.

00:04:34.777 --> 00:04:36.570
- 'Cause it had been so many years.

00:04:36.570 --> 00:04:37.980
I started to get a little worried.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.577
- Well, you know, when
it's meant to happen...

00:04:39.577 --> 00:04:41.578
- [Drew] I got too good at being alone.

00:04:41.578 --> 00:04:43.590
- Well, no, no. You know what?

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.420
Being alone is not a bad thing.

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:47.019
- I love it too much.

00:04:47.019 --> 00:04:50.790
(audience laughing)
- Well, perhaps,

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:54.960
if you are not knitting it
together with other stuff,

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.630
you can be alone and then not alone.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.590
And then alone.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:04:59.580
And then not alone.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:02.280
- So you could compartmentalize
it a little bit.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:03.750
- Hit and run.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:07.360
So maybe a hit and run
is a better way to go.

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.193
(Drew laughing)

00:05:08.193 --> 00:05:09.810
(audience applauding)

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:11.370
For now.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.270
For now.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:15.210
Until you're, until you
say to yourself, you know,

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:20.210
now I really want someone
to just be part of this.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.070
Right now, that may not be
what you're looking for,

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:27.060
which is probably why you're doing fine.

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:29.040
- So you don't ever get like itchy

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.200
to include somebody in the picture?

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.580
- For good? No.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.840
- [Drew] But a hit and run?

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:34.822
- Hit and runs are great.

00:05:34.822 --> 00:05:36.960
(audience laughing)

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:37.793
Because I...

00:05:37.793 --> 00:05:38.940
- Do you still hit and run?

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:39.869
- All the time.

00:05:39.869 --> 00:05:42.665
(Drew squeals excitedly)

00:05:42.665 --> 00:05:43.873
All the time.

00:05:43.873 --> 00:05:46.305
(audience applauding)

00:05:46.305 --> 00:05:48.972
Now, here's what's gonna happen.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:55.325
Now that I've said this to
you, that's all I'm gonna see.

00:05:55.325 --> 00:05:56.670
(Drew laughing)

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:57.960
Who is the hit and run?

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:59.880
People are gonna try to figure it out.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:00.933
You can't.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.240
You can't figure it out.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:08.193
Because I made it a point to
make sure that that was mine.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:10.800
I didn't wanna share it.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.850
You know, I don't want it

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:16.850
to be part of other people's
humor stories about me.

00:06:16.944 --> 00:06:18.090
- Yep.

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:19.283
- Hit and run.

00:06:19.283 --> 00:06:21.300
(Drew laughing)

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:22.614
- I almost did a spit take.

00:06:22.614 --> 00:06:23.583
- I know you did.

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:26.166
(upbeat music)

